    "family_reading": {
        "text": "SpaceXAI Grok is an API only line, so there are no open weights to download or self host, and every one of the 7 listed versions supports reasoning. Context windows run from 256000 to 2000000 tokens, and output limits are generous, up to 1800000 tokens on the two Grok 4.20 entries. Inputs cover file, image and text, with text output. Pricing splits into two groups: the 4.20 and 4.3 versions at $1.25 per million input and $2.5 output, and the newer 4.5, 4.6 and 4.7 at $2 input and $6 output, while Grok Build 0.1 sits at $1 input and $2 output. The family suits long document, image and file analysis where reasoning matters, but the newest tiers cost roughly double the older ones, and the largest contexts belong to the cheaper 4.20 releases rather than the newest.",
